backlog_batch_b2.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/backlog_batch_a1.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-da[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-da/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Re-check the macOS aliases completion flake after the deadline[bold white on #D75F87][/bold #D7AFFF] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]pin[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]macos-completion-flake[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]macos-completion-flake: read bob-cli-b9 with audited reads, re-check it [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after f00854be (complete() now uses bob_completion_command with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]10000 ms test deadline), investigate complete_values empty-list path in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests/cli/aliases.rs, apply the same pin only if it shares the deadline [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, prove with loaded Linux runs, obtain macOS CI evidence via gh, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close only per b9_close_gate = ci_green; otherwise leave a coordination [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note. Do not assume a Linux pass proves macOS.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Keep language-mermaid through web-clip extraction[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mermaid-class[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mermaid-class: read bob-cli-d5, fix scripts/web_clip/web_clip_adapter.py[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]so Defuddle extraction preserves language-mermaid (tag/restore via data [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attribute or post-process), extend --self-test to cover the real capture[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, verify source.md/code.json record kind mermaid, and close [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-d5 with evidence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Correct the vault-format walk order and check the page[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-format-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-format-docs: read bob-cli-d8, fix docs/reference/vault-format.md [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lines 171-172 to PRE → NEW → PROJECTS → PENDING → NEXT → RECURRING → [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]TICKLER → ROTTEN → POST per src/native/freshness/state.rs Tier and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/freshness.md, check nearby explanations, run just docs-check, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close bob-cli-d8. Docs only, no behavior or memory changes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split embedded assets before the package breaches its cap[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]assets-split[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]assets-split: read bob-cli-ai, if assets_split = split_now move web-clip[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fonts, mermaid/defuddle vendor bundles, and large assets payloads into a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-obsidian-assets crate keeping include_bytes access, keep just [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]package-check green with headroom, and close bob-cli-ai; if defer, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record size evidence and leave the bead open with a monitor note. Do not[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]breach the 9 MiB failure cap.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-da","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-da.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-da.1"},"source_run_id":"run-8efbdba485445c552d686763eca0670f","started_at":"2026-10-27T20:34:20.592259+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"